"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "953583499465929", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_953583502799262_7717493466621687_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rg2Rw25TstYQ7kNvwF3wE3b&_nc_oc=AdrDFkJYpdkUsNnIS4doMGIujWd4MQkgPaEOsesDakB5CEJnBThyn61urS2nsj165MY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT95AEAmylFbOG9nP9JBL52H6J_MfNtaHgqNKxALIfeOw&oe=6AE751B9"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "674727871253761", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974682_674727877920427_8234906938471221919_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mhSq8I7ivv4Q7kNvwFYgrgd&_nc_oc=AdrC4huPD-hfc0NisMOhSuLL0B5rxwdihggRYdFmQFBqb4gsf4nvtFfKPEVgm_8jrR4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRj0mDqQR-qIFu5TDZoHe0qKW5MLMOFPPInde5EqG5Keg&oe=6AE74472"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "693475392856477", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974606_693475396189810_4544538025249204410_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AEvZLlwLIWIQ7kNvwFbCg0c&_nc_oc=AdqTheP7chtB2uGUjfhZO-i4wU4AmKvc6r94HRVRG4mT4W7m-OkIdnj3bJMdBZXVnyY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQwQ10_L85yuPtujkYuNz5-DRd38HXrzYzyEwCySNzoCQ&oe=6AE758EA"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "426084476440862", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003242_426084479774195_5054665699376423939_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KgLk__-KWhsQ7kNvwGODBri&_nc_oc=AdoWXuTRsZIc9dNeBmLqKKYYUt1Z9UwvVPSchwVgxyxhI3w8N5yKTedhgWOwAjKSkQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTgBkTK_Ry7B9-uB5v0dS0h9GC-kbMD2ho8RdcQ4mbUMQ&oe=6AE747B9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "400957839162318", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982613_400957842495651_5849257638523868269_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A-kTAbIEOjAQ7kNvwG8shmx&_nc_oc=AdrHJGrIjlPFlZthQvXleRO0DftXPLqvhbwlv5ZIFrdgQavC_komIojuIR1uQMYPo1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSHohvlako5gkqvJThiwzhd-S3xwn5h9fpRBQe108ybAw&oe=6AE7524F"}, "display_name": "Offroad MotorBike", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Embark on an adrenaline-fueled journey with our immersive VR Offroad MotorBike game, available now on Meta Quest! Get ready to experience the thrill of conquering challenging terrains and mastering a variety of powerful offroad motorcycles.\n\nKey Features:\n\nDiverse and Challenging Tracks:\nExplore a multitude of exhilarating offroad tracks, each presenting unique challenges that will test your skills and determination. From rugged mountain trails to sandy desert dunes, the adventure never ends.\n\nExtensive Motorcycle Selection:\nChoose from a diverse range of high-performance offroad motorcycles, each with its own distinct characteristics. Whether you prefer speed, agility, or raw power, find the perfect bike to match your riding style.\n\nImmersive VR Experience:\nDive into the heart-pounding action with our VR technology that puts you right in the rider's seat. Feel the wind on your face as you navigate through the twists and turns of offroad landscapes.\n\nRealistic Physics and Graphics:\nOur game boasts realistic physics and stunning graphics, delivering an authentic offroad racing experience. Feel the mud splatter, hear the engines roar, and see the dust rise as you tear through the challenging courses.\n\nGear up, rev your engines, and prepare for the offroad adventure of a lifetime in Offroad MotorBike VR \u2013 where every twist of the throttle brings you closer to victory!", "short_description": "Get ready for an immersive offroad experience! Conquer challenging tracks and leave your competition in the dust with Offroad MotorBike VR on Meta Quest. With realistic physics, stunning graphics, and VR technology, Download now and kickstart your offroad adventure!"}]}, "developer_name": 